OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786042168
OL,3,CLoganair to close Southampton base at
OL,4,Cend of October
OL,6,FLoganair has said it will close its
OL,7,FSouthampton base at the end of October.
OL,9,FThe airline said its Southampton to
OL,10,FManchester service will operate for
OL,11,Fthe final time on Thursday 20 August.
OL,13,FLoganair said it follows "a review of
OL,14,Four wider network and operational
OL,15,Fsetup".
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
