OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786042168
OL,3,CLoganair to close Southampton base at
OL,4,Cend of October
OL,6,FIn a statement, a spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"Customers affected by these changes
OL,8,Fwill be contacted directly and will be
OL,9,Foffered alternative options where
OL,10,Favailable, or a refund where no
OL,11,Fsuitable alternative exists.
OL,13,F"This demand-led decision is part of a
OL,14,Fwider strategic update, which sees
OL,15,Fchanges to operating bases and overall
OL,16,Fnetwork delivery.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
