CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786042168
OL,3,CLoganair to close Southampton base at
OL,4,Cend of October
OL,6,F"These decisions reflect the same
OL,7,Fdisciplined, decisive approach that
OL,8,Fhas driven previous improvements in
OL,9,FLoganair's punctuality and resilience,
OL,10,Fprotecting the long-term future of the
OL,11,Fairline, our people, and the lifeline
OL,12,Fconnectivity we provide to communities
OL,13,Facross our network."
OL,15,FA Southampton Airport spokesperson
OL,16,Fadded: "We are disappointed by
OL,17,FLoganair's decision to withdraw its
OL,18,FSouthampton-Manchester service and
OL,19,Fclose its operating base at
OL,20,FSouthampton later this year.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
