OL,3,CLoganair to close Southampton base at
OL,4,Cend of October
OL,6,F"Loganair remains an important airline
OL,7,Fpartner and we thank the team for
OL,8,Ftheir contribution to connectivity
OL,9,Ffrom Southampton over recent years."
